    "purposeSentences": [
      {
        "text": "The Reporting Persons acquired the Shares because they believed the Shares, when purchased, were undervalued and represented an attractive investment opportunity.",
        "tags": [],
        "reservation": false
      },
      {
        "text": "On September 16, 2026, the Reporting Persons delivered a letter to the Issuer\u2019s Chief Executive Officer requesting a meeting to discuss the composition of the Board of Directors of the Issuer (the \u201cBoard\u201d).",
        "tags": ["letter", "board"],
        "reservation": false
      },
      {
        "text": "On October 7, 2026, the Reporting Persons delivered a letter to the Board, a copy of which is filed as Exhibit 99.2 hereto, stating that the Reporting Persons intend to nominate four candidates for election to the Board at the Issuer\u2019s 2027 annual meeting of stockholders.",
        "tags": ["letter", "board", "proxy"],
        "reservation": false
      },
      {
        "text": "If the Issuer does not agree to reconstitute the Board, the Reporting Persons intend to solicit proxies in support of their nominees.",
        "tags": ["proxy", "board"],
        "reservation": false
      },
      {
        "text": "The Reporting Persons believe the Shares are undervalued and that the Board should form a committee of independent directors to review strategic alternatives.",
        "tags": [],
        "reservation": false
      },
      {
        "text": "The Reporting Persons intend to review their investment in the Issuer on a continuing basis and, depending on various factors, may from time to time engage in discussions with management, the Board, other stockholders and other relevant parties, and may take positions with respect to any of the matters set forth in clauses (a) through (j) of Item 4 of Schedule 13D.",
        "tags": [],
        "reservation": true
      }
    ],
